    "updated_at": "2017-09-18T14:22:03Z",
    "body": "> What is the purpose of the store at all?\r\n\r\nThe main reason to indicate something is being stored is https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-clear-site-data/issues/37. Maybe we should have a simpler primitive for that though. (I don't think we should treat protocol handlers as permissions since the URL can carry quite a bit of data and therefore needs to be cleared along with other storage.)",
